NNAAMMEE
       nsupdate - dynamic DNS update utility

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       nnssuuppddaattee  [--dd]  [--DD]  [--ii]  [--LL  level]  [  [--gg]  |  [--oo]  | [--ll] | [--yy
