              server  sseerrvveerrnnaammee.  When no server statement is provided, nnssuupp‐‐
              ddaattee sends updates to the primary server of  the  correct  zone.
              The  MNAME  field of that zone's SOA record identify the primary
              server for that zone.  ppoorrtt is the  port  number  on  sseerrvveerrnnaammee
              where the dynamic update requests are sent. If no port number is
              specified, the default DNS port number of 53 is used.

              NNOOTTEE::
                 This command has no effect when GSS-TSIG is in use.

       llooccaall aaddddrreessss ppoorrtt
